        "TileImage": "$($repository 9454339d-8f29-4ae6-97f4-96523a48bf08).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned four High Value Targets (HVTs) at the pirate coves of Ambrose Island. Below are the listed targets as well as the preferred methods for dealing with them;\r\rEliminate Joyo Yani and Carlton Smith (AGAIN) by electrocution.\rEliminate Farah with injected lethal poison. \rEliminate Orson &quot;Sean 2.0&quot; Mills with a pistol headshot.\r\rPlan accordingly, these pirates are not from the Carribean. We ask that you avoid collateral damage. \r\rWalk &apos;em off the plank and good luck!\rReapingZ",
